Your next getaway, right in your pocket.

Les Pépites de France helps you (re)discover more than 3000 exceptional spots all across France: from must-sees like the Eiffel Tower to the lesser-known Devil's Canyon, and including national parks, there’s something for everyone.

Embrace local tourism with:

Over 3000 hidden gems cataloged, with monthly updates and additions;
Itinerary suggestions in your Apple Maps, Google Maps, Waze, or Citymapper;
Display of gems near your location;
Filters on listed spots to find the perfect gem for you;
The ability to suggest your own hidden gems to share with our community of over 2 million people.
